
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Data-Engineer-Repository">
    <title>Data-Engineering-Repository</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #e5e7eb;
            background: #111827;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 70px 20px;
            background: #1f2937;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: #d1d5db;
        }

        nav {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #0f172a;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #e5e7eb;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 12px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        section {
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            padding: 25px;
            background: #1f2937;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .project, .job {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        a {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 5px 8px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Data Engineering Repository</h1>
        <p>Building reliable data pipelines and transforming raw data into insights.</p>
        <p>Data Engineer | SQL | Python | ETL | Power BI</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
        <a href="#experience">Experience</a>
        <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <section id="about">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>
                I am an aspiring Data Engineer interested in building data
                pipelines, managing databases, and developing efficient
                data processing solutions.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section id="skills">
            <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>SQL and Database Management</li>
                <li>Python, Pandas, and NumPy</li>
                <li>ETL and Data Pipeline Development</li>
                <li>Excel and Power BI</li>
                <li>Data Cleaning and Transformation</li>
                <li>Git and GitHub</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="experience">
            <h2>Experience</h2>

            <div class="job">
                <h3>Inventory Analyst | Hardik Construction</h3>
                <p><em>January 2026 – July 2026</em></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Managed inventory records and maintained data accuracy.</li>
                    <li>Used Excel for tracking, reporting, and data analysis.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="job">
                <h3>Sales Executive | My Money Mantra</h3>
                <p><em>June 2025 – December 2025</em></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Maintained customer records and sales data.</li>
                    <li>Prepared reports to support sales operations.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="projects">
            <h2>Projects</h2>

            <div class="project">
                <h3>Supply Chain Analytics</h3>
                <p>
                    Analyzed shipment data using Python, Pandas, NumPy,
                    and machine learning to study delivery delays.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="project">
                <h3>PhonePe Transaction Analysis</h3>
                <p>
                    Developed a Power BI dashboard to analyze transaction
                    trends across Indian states.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact">
            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>Email: your-email@example.com</p>
            <p>
                GitHub:
                <a href="https://github.com/ankitkumar6395"
                   target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    View GitHub Profile
                </a>
            </p>
            <p>
                LinkedIn:
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ankitkumar6395/"
                   target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    View LinkedIn Profile
                </a>
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Data Engineering Repository. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
